---
const today = new Date();
---

<footer class="footer">
	<p class="copyright">© {today.getFullYear()} 投資百科. All rights reserved.</p>
	<p class="disclaimer">本站內容僅供參考，不構成投資建議。投資有風險，請謹慎評估。</p>
</footer>

<style>
	.footer {
		background: var(--bg-secondary, #1a1a2e);
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border, #2d3748);
		padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
		text-align: center;
		margin-top: 3rem;
	}

	.copyright {
		color: var(--text-secondary, #94a3b8);
		font-size: 0.875rem;
		margin: 0 0 0.25rem 0;
	}

	.disclaimer {
		color: var(--text-muted, #64748b);
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		margin: 0;
	}
</style>
